1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:07,000
From the beginning of time, we battled against the very substance that keeps us alive.

2
00:00:07,001 --> 00:00:08,000
Water.

3
00:00:08,001 --> 00:00:11,000
It's a love-hate relationship.

4
00:00:11,001 --> 00:00:15,000
