5
00:00:15,001 --> 00:00:20,000
Through technology and ingenuity, we're always finding new ways to stay dry.

6
00:00:20,001 --> 00:00:26,000
From the roof over our heads, to the clothing we wear and cases we carry.

7
00:00:26,001 --> 00:00:30,400
From boring tunnels deep under it to building vessels that dive deep into it.

8
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:35,060
This is the amazing story of staying dry.

9
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:38,240
Now, waterproof on Modern Marvels.

10
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:55,000
From the terrifying force of a tsunami,

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
to the insidious seat of a hidden leak.

12
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,160
