13
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:11,680
Humans have long struggled to manage water by channeling it, containing it, and blocking it.

14
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:19,120
Nowhere is this fight more evident than in one of the most densely populated cities in the world

15
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:21,920
