33
00:02:53,421 --> 00:02:56,680
That makes water management one of the subway's biggest worries.

34
00:02:56,681 --> 00:03:03,480
You dig down, let's say, 10, 20 feet, you start heating water.

35
00:03:03,481 --> 00:03:09,040
Peter Strasser is head of Wisco America, a company that specializes in large-scale underground

36
00:03:09,041 --> 00:03:11,840
