52
00:04:27,341 --> 00:04:36,380
Average maintenance costs can range between $500,000 a month.

53
00:04:36,381 --> 00:04:41,580
It's a daunting task to keep New York's 800 miles of track dry.

54
00:04:41,581 --> 00:04:47,620
New York subway is one of the oldest, largest and busiest rapid transit systems in the world.

55
00:04:47,621 --> 00:04:53,120
It is the circulatory system of the city, with 4 million riders a day.

56
00:04:53,121 --> 00:04:55,220
But the city is still growing.

57
00:04:55,221 --> 00:05:00,600
So now it's carrying out the biggest subway expansion in two generations.

58
00:05:00,601 --> 00:05:06,220
