129
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:16,840
Kittredge served on submarines during World War II.

130
00:10:18,060 --> 00:10:21,880
On seven patrols, his sub torpedoed 16 enemy ships.

131
00:10:22,420 --> 00:10:26,140
At the end of the war, he was promoted to captain at age 26.

132
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:36,580
A couple of decades later, Kittredge began designing personal submarines.

133
00:10:36,581 --> 00:10:42,340
Today there are an estimated 100 Kittredge-designed personal subs prowling the depths.

134
00:10:42,341 --> 00:10:43,840
