143
00:11:15,981 --> 00:11:19,400
But the history of submarines goes way back.

144
00:11:19,401 --> 00:11:25,060
In the 1620s, a Dutchman named Cornelius Drebel invented a working sub with a shell made of

145
00:11:25,061 --> 00:11:26,900
