00:13:42,061 --> 00:13:47,380
It takes about two minutes for Mark Reagan to submerge his K-250 15 feet into the waters

181
00:13:47,381 --> 00:13:50,240
of Glee Bay, an inlet of the Chesapeake.

182
00:13:50,241 --> 00:13:54,380
When I vent these ballast tanks, I become neutral in the water, just like a fish and

